  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 71669891072
    m_Localized: Be Queen Bee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 190754570240
    m_Localized: Play as a Queen Bee and command your swarm with pheromone marks
      in this action-strategy game. Take the meadows from the enemy and escape the
      starvation. Surround enemies in real-time, take their honey, and evolve. Your
      pheromone is law.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 361315942400
    m_Localized: 'Cartapli : Fold Quest'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1102608842752
    m_Localized: 'Cartapli: fold Quest is a turn-based combat game combining strategy
      roguelike mechanics with unique origami puzzles. Fold the paper to shift positions
      and defeat all enemies!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281920
    m_Localized: D1AL-ogue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281921
    m_Localized: Become an android repair technician in a cyberpunk city where the
      sun never rises. Rotate the unique circular puzzle 'D1AL' and merge modules
      to fix their broken bodies and hearts. Your precise repair is the conversation
      starter. Turn the dial and listen to their stories.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281922
    m_Localized: EXE.CUTOR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281923
    m_Localized: EXE.CUTOR is a game where you place data blocks to complete lines.
      Acquire various equipment and enhance your data blocks to build stronger lines
      and defeat virus hosts infesting cyberspace!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281924
    m_Localized: In My Bubble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281925
    m_Localized: In My Bubble is a 3D action-adventure platformer featuring a child
      in a cute earflap hat on a quest to save the sheep of the dream world. Explore
      a world overtaken by darkness, rescue corrupted sheep, and restore the lost
      morning using the power of bubbles!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281926
    m_Localized: No Mana, Just Dice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281927
    m_Localized: 'Zero Mana. Massive Debt.

      No Mana, Just Dice is a tactical
      turn-based roguelike. Play as a dropout witch who needs dice just to take a
      single step! Use your limited dice to maneuver and attack, outsmart your bad
      luck, and seize the wish-granting scroll to rewrite your fate.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281928
    m_Localized: Spacetime Shooter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6933811281929
    m_Localized: 'You are a sniper who controls time and space.

      Eliminate
      all enemies with a single bullet.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
